        "pages": [
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "GAME RULES"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• Play up to 50 lines.",
                        "",
                        "• Highest win only on each lit line.",
                        "",
                        "• Coinciding wins of different symbols are added.",
                        "",
                        "• Line wins are multiplied by the amount bet per line.",
                        "",
                        "• Scattered symbol wins are multiplied by total bet.",
                        "",
                        "• Scattered symbol wins are added to payline wins.",
                        "",
                        "• All symbols pay when they appear consecutively left to right, except scattered",
                        "",
                        "   ##sym_11.png##which pays on any position."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "GAME RULES"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• ##sym_1.png##substitutes for all symbols except scattered ##sym_11.png##.",
                        "",
                        "• Each ##sym_1.png##is collected and can award the Magical Fairies Feature."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "INSTANT WIN FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• The Instant Win Feature is triggered when ##sym_12.png##appears 5 or more times in",
                        "",
                        "   a combination.",
                        "",
                        "• Each ##sym_12.png##will reveal a prize.",
                        "",
                        "• Prizes are awarded for each ##sym_12.png##appearing during the feature.",
                        "",
                        "• All prizes are multiplied by the triggering bet."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "MAGICAL FAIRIES FEATURE"
                    },
                    {
                        "text": "HOLD & SPIN FEATURE",
                        "size": 33,
                        "align": "left",
                        "offset": "-500,-10",
                        "color": "rgb(165,246,255)",
                        "stroke": {
                            "size": 2,
                            "color": "rgb(39,83,195)"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• Each ##sym_1.png##is collected by The Fairies Tree.",
                        "",
                        "• When the Magical Fairies Feature is awarded, the Queen will reveal either the",
                        "",
                        "   Hold & Spin Feature or the Free Games Feature.",
                        "",
                        "",
                        "",
                        "• The Hold & Spin Feature commences with 6 ##sym_12.png##.",
                        "",
                        "• 3 respins are awarded and positions that don’t have ##sym_12.png##are respun.",
                        "",
                        "• During the Hold & Spin Feature, any ##sym_12.png##appears and the respins remaining",
                        "",
                        "   are reset to 3 respins."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "MAGICAL FAIRIES FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• The Red Fairy Feature and/or Green Fairy Feature can be awarded during the",
                        "",
                        "   Hold & Spin Feature.",
                        "",
                        "• The Hold & Spin Feature concludes when there are no respins left or all",
                        "",
                        "   positions on all feature reels are full.",
                        "",
                        "• At the end of Hold & Spin Feature, the Queen Fairy appears and multiplies",
                        "",
                        "   random ##sym_12.png##by up to 5 times, except Jackpots.",
                        "",
                        "• All Hold & Spin Feature prizes are multiplied by the triggering bet."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "MAGICAL FAIRIES FEATURE"
                    },
                    {
                        "text": "RED FAIRY FEATURE",
                        "size": 33,
                        "align": "left",
                        "offset": "-500,220",
                        "color": "rgb(165,246,255)",
                        "stroke": {
                            "size": 2,
                            "color": "rgb(39,83,195)"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "",
                        "• The Red Fairy Feature will appear at random adding additonal sets of reels to",
                        "",
                        "    the game.",
                        "",
                        "• When the Red Fairy appears, the current game screen is replicated and play",
                        "",
                        "    now continues with 2 sets of feature reels.",
                        "",
                        "• If the Red Fairy appears again, a third set of reels appears, commencing with",
                        "",
                        "    6 ##sym_12.png##.",
                        "",
                        "• A maximum of 3 sets of feature reels can be played during any feature."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "MAGICAL FAIRIES FEATURE"
                    },
                    {
                        "text": "GREEN FAIRY FEATURE",
                        "size": 33,
                        "align": "left",
                        "offset": "-500,220",
                        "color": "rgb(165,246,255)",
                        "stroke": {
                            "size": 2,
                            "color": "rgb(39,83,195)"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "text": "FREE GAMES FEATURE",
                        "size": 33,
                        "align": "left",
                        "offset": "-500,90",
                        "color": "rgb(165,246,255)",
                        "stroke": {
                            "size": 2,
                            "color": "rgb(39,83,195)"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "",
                        "• The Green Fairy Feature will add additional prizes at random on ##sym_12.png##.",
                        "",
                        "",
                        "",
                        "• 10, 15 or 20 free games are awarded.",
                        "",
                        "• Each time ##sym_1b.png##appears anywhere on reel 3, it turns ##sym_1b.png##for the duration",
                        "",
                        "    of the free games as follows:",
                        "",
                        "       • If 1 ##sym_1b.png##appears on reel 3, ##sym_2.png##becomes ##sym_13.png##."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "MAGICAL FAIRIES FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "       • If a 2nd ##sym_1b.png##appears on reel 3, all ##sym_2.png##and ##sym_3.png##",
                        "",
                        "           become ##sym_13.png##and ##sym_14.png##.",
                        "",
                        "       • If a 3rd ##sym_1b.png##appears on reel 3, all ##sym_2.png##, ##sym_3.png##and ##sym_4.png##",
                        "",
                        "           become ##sym_13.png##, ##sym_14.png##and ##sym_15.png##.",
                        "",
                        "       • If a 4th ##sym_1b.png##appears on reel 3, all ##sym_2.png##, ##sym_3.png##, ##sym_4.png##and ##sym_5.png##",
                        "",
                        "           become ##sym_13.png##, ##sym_14.png##, ##sym_15.png##and ##sym_16.png##.",
                        "",
                        "• Any symbol turned ##sym_1b.png##will stay ##sym_1b.png##for all remaining free games."
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "titles": [
                    {
                        "text": "MAGICAL FAIRIES FEATURE"
                    }
                ],
                "items": {
                    "lines": [
                        "• Prizes are awarded for each ##sym_12.png##appearing during the feature.",
                        "",
                        "• The Free Games Feature is played at the lines and bet of the triggering",
                        "",
                        "   combination.",
                        "",
                        "• Free Games Feature wins are added to payline wins and scattered symbol wins.",
                        "",
                        "• All ##sym_12.png##prizes are multiplied by the triggering bet."
                    ]
                }
            }
